'''Maws''' slowly drift towards Isaac while spitting a blood shot at him when near him, the latter behavior is similar to that of {{E|Horf}}s.

They resemble pale floating heads with misshapen eye sockets that drip blood and an open mouth with only two teeth.
{{clear}}

== Variants ==
=== Red Maw ===
{{infobox monster
 | name           = Red Maw
 | image name     = * {{dlc|nr|Rebirth}}
 | variant        = 1
 | base hp        = 20
 | environment    = {{floor|Caves}}{{floor|Catacombs}}{{floor|Flooded Caves}}<br>{{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{floor|Womb}}{{floor|Utero}}{{floor|Scarred Womb}}<br>{{floor|Chest}}
 | replace        = Maw
