'''Red Maws''' float towards Isaac considerably faster than the Maw but do not fire any projectiles. Instead it will fire 4 blood shots in cardinal directions upon death, similar to {{E|Sucker}}s.

They resemble other types of Maw, but with pink skin and a their mouth stitched shut, as if to prevent blood shots from being fired.
{{clear}}

=== Psychic Maw ===
{{infobox monster
 | name           = Psychic Maw
 | image name     = * {{dlc|nr|Rebirth}}
 | variant        = 2
 | base hp        = 20
 | environment    = {{floor|Caves}}{{floor|Flooded Caves}}<br>{{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{floor|Mausoleum}}<br>{{floor|Utero}}<br>{{floor|Cathedral}}
