'''Psychic Maws''' behave identically to Maws but fire purple homing shots that deal a whole heart of damage. Similar to the {{E|Hanger}}, the Psychic Maw will always spawn with an {{E|Eternal Fly}} circling it.

The Psychic Maw resembles a pale floating head with its eyes and mouth stitched shut and a third eye opened in its forehead dripping blood. The third eye emits a small purple fire.
{{clear}}

